<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A examination or checking of documentation, records, processes, or systems to confirm compliance or adherence with an upper level requirement. Typically done as peer review, offline review or review meeting."@en .
